{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cOne night, I opened my father\u2019s old diary\u2026 and found the truth he left behind.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Echoes of the Cove</i> is a <strong>2D adventure RPG</strong> about following in your father\u2019s footsteps following the missing pages of his old diary... uncovering his fate, exploring a forgotten coastal town and its mysterious surroundings, and revealing the secrets hidden beneath them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras/8c8fc31dfb89e95eef2d8b9d82ba10d0.avif?t=1761204111\" data-has-big width=1560 height=871 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore. Discover. Rebuild.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Follow the diary\u2019s clues</strong> across a hand-crafted open world filled with dungeons, puzzles, and stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle</strong> strange creatures in real-time combat using tools, weapons, and your wits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover</strong> the mysteries of <i>The Cove</i>, from the old lighthouse to the crypt buried beneath the city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet its last inhabitants</strong> \u2014 each with their own memories, regrets, and secrets. Forge bonds that may shape your destiny</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape your journey</strong> through choices and discoveries that bring you closer to your father's fate.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras/3ade67ad65dd3c5949808459249e7578.avif?t=1761204111\" alt=\"the_cove_town\" width=1275 height=685 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through storms, ruins, and fading echoes of the past in this story-rich adventure inspired by <i>classic Zelda</i> and <i>Stardew Valley</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras/09f15e84228baa1c66790a27da71d3d7.avif?t=1761204111\" data-has-big width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you find your father\u2026 or become another echo lost to The Cove?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras/8f7ee5217e814c103aa198eae34713cf.avif?t=1761204111\" alt=\"the_cemetery\" width=1277 height=714 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4094850?t=1761204111","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4094850?t=1761204111","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/dacb8949ee143df716d197580a7d7efb8a482682/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761204111","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/dacb8949ee143df716d197580a7d7efb8a482682/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761204111","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cOne night, I opened my father\u2019s old diary\u2026 and found 